          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for a result…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待结果…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working directories for %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的工作目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report changed while being read. Choose it again to retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取期间报告发生了变化。请重新选择后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog contains unsupported fields. Its original data was preserved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目目录包含不支持的字段，原始数据已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog contains conflicting or invalid projects. Its original data was preserved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目目录包含冲突或无效的项目，原始数据已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog could not be read. Recover the original file before saving changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取项目目录。请先恢复原始文件，再保存更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog changed outside this window. Changes are temporary; reopen MoeKit to reload the saved catalog.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目目录已在此窗口之外更改。当前更改仅临时保留；请重新打开 MoeKit 以重新载入已保存的目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The project catalog exceeds the 16 MB limit. Changes were not saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目目录超过 16 MB 限制，更改未保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a project folder or discover Git repositories in folders you choose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加一个项目文件夹，或在指定位置发现 Git 仓库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After discovery, Tasks shows progress, cancellation and actual results. Git working-tree changes are not checked yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发现任务的进度、取消状态和实际结果会显示在「任务」中。目前还不检查 Git 工作区的修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before you start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始前先了解"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Add project for one folder, or Discover in folder to find Git repositories and review what to import. Only selected folders are read; no project files are changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用「添加项目」选择单个文件夹，或用「在文件夹中发现」查找 Git 仓库并复查要导入的项目。只读取所选文件夹，不修改项目文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Import report to open an existing Mole analyze --json file. MoeKit reads only that file; it does not run Mole or scan the paths in the report. Report sizes are not reclaimable space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击「导入报告」打开已有的 Mole analyze --json 文件。MoeKit 只读取该文件，不运行 Mole，也不扫描报告中的路径。报告大小不等于可回收空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Start scan in the toolbar to read current-user executable names and paths, working directories and TCP listening endpoints. No command arguments, environment variables or process signals. Nothing is scanned automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击工具栏的「开始扫描」，读取当前用户的可执行文件名称和路径、工作目录、TCP 监听地址与端口。不读取命令参数或环境变量，不发送进程信号，也不会自动扫描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a first step and learn what this preview can read and do.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择第一步，了解当前预览能读取什么、能做什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo uses built-in examples. Entering Demo does not scan folders or processes, import reports, or replace your saved projects. Processes & Ports has no Demo scan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "示例模式使用内置数据。进入时不会扫描文件夹或进程、导入报告，也不会替换已保存的项目。「进程与端口」没有示例扫描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explore Projects, Tools and Tasks. The Demo banner stays visible; use Exit demo whenever you want to return to your own data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览「项目」「工具」和「任务」。示例模式会一直显示提示；随时点「退出示例」返回自己的数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find your current user’s processes and TCP listening ports with a read-only snapshot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过只读快照，查看当前用户的进程和 TCP 监听端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Getting started": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上手引导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Getting started…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上手引导…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to Processes & Ports": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前往进程与端口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to Projects": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前往项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Processes & Ports, choose Start scan when you’re ready. Select a row to see its identity, ports and project-association evidence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "进入「进程与端口」后，准备好再点「开始扫描」。选择一行即可查看进程身份、端口和项目关联依据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Projects, choose Add project for one folder, or Discover in folder to find Git repositories. Review discovery results before importing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "进入「项目」后，用「添加项目」选择单个文件夹，或用「在文件夹中发现」查找 Git 仓库。发现后先复查，再导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look around with examples": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先看看示例"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mole Space can import reports or analyze a folder with the supported official V1.57.0 analyzer after confirmation. Cleanup, uninstall and stopping other processes remain unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole 的「空间」可导入报告，或经确认后使用受支持的官方 V1.57.0 分析器分析文件夹。清理、卸载和停止其他进程尚不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open getting started": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开上手引导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Organize my projects": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理我的项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quick guide": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上手引导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading starts only after you choose a folder. Discovery is bounded and read-only. Project paths, names and pins are saved locally; project files are not changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有选定文件夹后才开始读取。发现范围有限且只读；项目路径、名称和置顶信息保存在本机，不修改项目文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See processes and ports": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看进程与端口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip for now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时跳过"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This button opens the workspace. It does not start a scan or ask for folder access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下面的按钮只打开对应页面，不会开始扫描或请求文件夹访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try example projects, task results and a Mole report before using your own data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先体验示例项目、任务结果和 Mole 报告，再使用自己的数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to MoeKit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 MoeKit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What would you like to do first?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "想先做什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can reopen this guide from Help or Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之后可从「帮助」或「设置」重新打开引导。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your first step": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一步怎么做"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your projects, tools and task results, together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把项目、工具和任务结果放在一起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A snapshot is read only when you choose Start scan or Refresh: current-user executable names and paths, working directories, and TCP listening endpoints. Command arguments and environment variables are not read. No process signals are sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有点击「开始扫描」或「刷新」才读取快照：当前用户的可执行文件名称和路径、工作目录、TCP 监听地址与端口。不读取命令参数或环境变量，不向进程发送信号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected folders could not be read. Choose accessible folders and try again. No files were changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取所选文件夹。请选择可访问的文件夹后重试。未更改任何文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes could not be saved. They are temporary; check available disk space and folder access, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法保存更改，目前仅临时保留。请检查可用磁盘空间和文件夹访问权限后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file is not a supported Mole JSON report. Export a new analyze --json report and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选文件不是受支持的 Mole JSON 报告。请重新导出 analyze --json 报告后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report could not be read. Check access to the selected file and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取报告。请检查所选文件的访问权限后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo mode uses example projects and results. Changing modes cancels current discovery and report imports. It never starts a process or changes project files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demo 模式使用示例项目和结果。切换模式会取消当前的项目发现和报告导入，不会启动进程或更改项目文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another MoeKit window is saving the catalog. Changes are temporary; try saving again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一个 MoeKit 窗口正在保存项目目录。当前更改仅临时保留，请再次保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The catalog lock is not a private regular file. Changes were not saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目目录锁不是仅当前用户可访问的普通文件，更改未保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A regular file has executable permission bits. Its contents, tool identity and version have not been checked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找到带可执行权限位的普通文件，但未检查内容、工具身份或版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A symbolic link exists. Its target, tool identity and version have not been checked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找到符号链接，但未检查其目标、工具身份或版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancelling inspection…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在取消检查…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check common locations": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查常见位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check file locations and find official installation instructions. Finding a file does not verify a working or trusted tool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查文件位置并查看官方安装说明。找到文件并不代表工具可用或可信。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a candidate file to inspect its metadata. It will not be run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择候选文件以检查其元数据，不会运行该文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a local, absolute file path without invalid characters.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择不含无效字符的本地绝对文件路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copied": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy command": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copying only changes the clipboard. Running this command yourself can install dependencies, access the network and update Homebrew. Review the official instructions first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制仅更新剪贴板。你自行运行此命令可能安装依赖、访问网络并更新 Homebrew，请先查看官方说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not inspect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found · unverified": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已找到 · 未验证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you already use Homebrew, its documented install command is:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你已在使用 Homebrew，官方文档中的安装命令为："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect another file…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查其他文件…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect metadata": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查元数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspecting file metadata…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查文件元数据…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install or review manually": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手动安装或查看说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location checks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位置检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locations checked by this button": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此按钮检查的位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Metadata could not be read. This does not mean the tool is missing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取元数据，这不代表工具不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mole execution remains unavailable. Space can import a JSON report without installing or running Mole. No cleanup command is connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole 执行尚未接入。空间页面无需安装或运行 Mole 即可导入 JSON 报告。清理命令尚未连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not found at this path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此路径未找到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Official installation instructions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官方安装说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only metadata is inspected. No version command, shell, installer or tool is started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅读取文件元数据，不运行版本命令、Shell、安装程序或工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other installation locations have not been checked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未检查其他安装位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Project discovery reads Git metadata without running Git. A file at /usr/bin/git may be an Apple launcher; it does not prove Command Line Tools are installed. Git status execution remains unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目发现直接读取 Git 元数据，不运行 Git。/usr/bin/git 可能是 Apple 启动器，存在此文件不代表已安装命令行工具。Git 状态执行尚未接入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The inspection did not finish. No tool was run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查未完成，没有运行任何工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This location is not a regular file or a symbolic link.": {
