    },
    "Mole Space can import reports or analyze a folder with the supported official V1.57.0 analyzer after confirmation. Native cache cleanup requires exact selection and confirmation. Other tools show their available actions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole Space 可导入报告，或在确认后使用受支持的官方 V1.57.0 分析器分析文件夹。原生缓存清理需要精确选择并确认。其他工具会显示各自可用的操作。"
          }
