    "Homebrew installation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mole command location": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole 命令位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This location could not be safely checked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法安全检查此位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No analyzer was found at this location. Custom locations have not been searched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此位置未找到分析器；尚未搜索自定义安装位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This location could not be read. That does not mean Mole is missing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取此位置，不代表未安装 Mole。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Mole command is present. Commands and shell wrappers are never run during setup, so this does not verify an analyzer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找到了 Mole 命令。检测不会运行命令或 Shell 包装脚本，因此尚未验证分析器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This analyzer path is a link or is not a regular file. It was not followed or run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此分析器路径是链接或不是普通文件，未跟随链接，也未运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Homebrew link points outside the expected Mole installation. It was not accepted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 链接指向了预期 Mole 安装位置之外，未接受此文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The analyzer matches the reviewed official release for this app. It will be checked again before analysis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析器与本应用已审查的官方发布文件一致，开始分析前还会再次验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file does not match the supported official release. Homebrew builds, custom builds, other versions and another architecture can differ. Nothing was run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件与受支持的官方发布文件不一致，可能是 Homebrew 编译版、自行构建、其他版本或其他架构。未运行任何工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS quarantine is present. MoeKit will not remove it or bypass Gatekeeper. Review the system warning before continuing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件带有 macOS 隔离标记。MoeKit 不会移除标记或绕过 Gatekeeper；请先处理系统安全提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The analyzer could not be verified or changed during the check. Recheck before continuing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证分析器，或文件在检测期间发生变化。请重新检测后再继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installation check did not finish. Recheck to try again. No tool was run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装检测未完成，请点击重新检测重试。未运行任何工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Inspect source and target": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 检查源工作树与目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Review local integration": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 复查本地合并"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Local integration verified": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 已验证本地合并"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. Optional remote handoff": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. 按需处理远端操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5. Review worktree retirement separately": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5. 单独复查工作树退役"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back to Git cleanup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回 Git 整理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel inspection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancelling stops further checks. A running private query must finish its supervisor timeout and exit checks; closing this view is not immediate termination.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消会停止后续检查。正在运行的私有查询仍须完成监督程序的超时与退出检查；关闭此视图不会立即终止它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a parent containing both the main repository and the linked worktree.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择同时包含主仓库和关联工作树的父目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose shared parent folder…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择共同父目录…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close tools using both worktrees. This is a fresh bounded check, not an atomic filesystem snapshot or proof that no other program can write. Do not edit or run Git until verification finishes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请关闭使用这两个工作树的工具。本次有界复查不是原子文件系统快照，也不能证明其他程序无法写入。验证完成前，请勿编辑文件或运行 Git。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm local fast-forward": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认本地快进合并"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extra directories": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "额外目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fast-forward only: the target branch moves to the source commit. If the target is checked out in the primary worktree, its tracked files and index are updated too. Source files and the source branch stay in place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅支持快进合并：将目标分支推进到源提交。如果目标分支已在主工作树中检出，还会更新该工作树的受跟踪文件和 index。源文件和源分支保持原位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish AI worktree": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成 AI 工作树收尾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish AI worktree…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成 AI 工作树收尾…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I closed terminals, editors and Git operations using both worktrees": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我已关闭使用这两个工作树的终端、编辑器和 Git 操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect finish plan": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查收尾计划"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspecting local Git state…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查本地 Git 状态…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspection reads only the selected scope and copies bounded Git objects into an app-owned temporary directory. A verified Apple Git binary inspects that copy. No repository hooks, filters, scripts or network operations run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查仅读取选定范围，并将有界 Git 对象复制到应用自有的临时目录，由经过验证的 Apple Git 检查副本。不会运行仓库 hooks、filters、脚本或网络操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Integrating and verifying locally…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在进行本地合并与验证…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the recovery folder if an operation is interrupted. Local integration has no automatic undo in this view.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作中断时，请保留恢复目录。此视图不提供本地合并的自动撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Modified tracked files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已修改的受跟踪文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit has not fetched, pushed, created a pull request, or checked remote CI. If remote integration is needed, review and complete that step in your Git client or hosting service before retiring the worktree.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 尚未 fetch、push、创建 PR 或检查远端 CI。如需合入远端，请先在 Git 客户端或托管服务中复查并完成该步骤，再退役工作树。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit rechecked the local target ref and applicable worktree/index against the source commit. This does not verify project behavior or test results.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 已按照源提交重新核对本地目标 ref，以及适用的工作树和 index。此验证不涵盖项目行为或测试结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Present": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Previous integration needs review": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次合并需要复查"
          }
        }
      }
