    },
    "The branches have diverged. Resolve the merge in your Git client; both worktrees are retained.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分支历史已分叉。请在 Git 客户端中处理合并；两个工作树均会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next screen starts a new inspection. A separate confirmation can move the clean worktree into recovery while keeping its branch. Retirement does not reclaim disk space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一步会开始新的检查。经单独确认后，可将干净的工作树移入恢复目录，并保留其分支。退役不会回收磁盘空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The primary target worktree is not exactly clean. Preserve its changes before merging.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主工作树中的目标并非完全干净。请先妥善保存其改动，再进行合并。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The source has no commits missing from this target. Review retirement separately in Git cleanup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "源分支没有目标尚未包含的提交。可在 Git 整理中单独复查退役。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The source has no commits to add to this target. You can inspect retirement separately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "源分支没有可加入此目标的新提交。可以单独检查退役条件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The source worktree has staged, modified, untracked, ignored, or extra directory content. Preserve it before merging.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "源工作树中存在暂存、已修改、未跟踪、被忽略的文件或额外目录。请先妥善保存这些内容，再进行合并。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The target must be an existing local branch. A clean checked-out primary worktree can be updated; diverged histories and unsupported layouts require Git outside MoeKit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标必须是现有本地分支。已检出目标分支且干净的主工作树可以更新；历史分叉或不支持的布局需在 MoeKit 外使用 Git 处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This confirmation authorizes only local integration. Retiring the worktree requires another inspection and confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此次确认仅授权本地合并。退役工作树需要再次检查并单独确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a session record, not a fresh inspection. Inspect the current source and target again before another operation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是本次会话的操作记录，不是最新检查结果。再次操作前，请重新检查当前源与目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type the exact target branch name to confirm": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入完整且准确的目标分支名以确认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Untracked and ignored files are counted together and protected. MoeKit does not run repository ignore rules or classify ignored files separately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未跟踪和被忽略的文件会合并计数并受保护。MoeKit 不运行仓库忽略规则，也不单独判断哪些文件被忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Untracked or ignored files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未跟踪或被忽略的文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use shared parent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用共同父目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verified commit: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已验证提交：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Push to a remote branch before retirement": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退役前推送到远端分支"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local-only finish selected. No remote push is authorized.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已选择仅本地收尾，尚未授权远端推送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. Review and verify the remote push": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. 复查并验证远端推送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact HTTPS repository URL": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精确的 HTTPS 仓库地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remote branch name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远端分支名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a plain HTTPS URL, such as https://github.com/owner/repository.git, and an existing remote branch. Remote configuration from the repository is not used. No fetch, branch creation, force push, or remote deletion is available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入普通 HTTPS 地址（例如 https://github.com/owner/repository.git）及已有远端分支。不会采用仓库内的远端配置，也不提供 fetch、新建分支、强制推送或远端删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Credential destination: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "凭据使用目标：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact remote ref: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精确远端引用：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I allow this connection to use existing macOS Keychain Git credentials for this exact host and repository path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我允许此连接为这个精确主机和仓库路径使用现有 macOS 钥匙串 Git 凭据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This may read existing credentials even during inspection. Credentials are not shown or logged; the fixed helper cannot store or erase them. Sign in with your Git client first if access is unavailable. Git may internally use a shell only to dispatch MoeKit's fixed credential helper. Repository hooks are disabled; a fixed native gate checks the approved push target.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查远端时也可能读取现有凭据。不会显示或记录凭据；固定辅助程序不能保存或删除它们。无法访问时，请先在 Git 客户端检查登录。Git 内部可能通过 shell 调用 MoeKit 的固定凭据辅助程序。仓库 hooks 禁用，由固定原生检查程序核对已批准的推送目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect exact remote branch": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查精确远端分支"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pushing and independently checking the remote…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在推送并独立复查远端…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking the exact remote branch…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查精确远端分支…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approved destination: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "批准的目标：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remote ref: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远端引用：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expected remote commit: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预期的远端提交：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commit to publish: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将发布的提交：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This sends the selected commit and its reachable Git history to the displayed repository using an ordinary non-force push. Confirm only if that repository should receive this code and history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作通过普通非强制推送，将所选提交及其可达 Git 历史发送到显示的仓库。仅在该仓库应收到这些代码与历史时确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type the exact refs/heads/branch to authorize this push": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入精确的 refs/heads/分支名以授权本次推送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm exact remote push": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认精确远端推送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The worktree stays available. Do not assume a timeout means the push failed, and do not retry blindly. Check the exact remote again without sending another push.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作树仍保留。超时不代表推送必然失败，请勿盲目重试。可重新检查精确远端，而不发送新的推送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recheck remote only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅复查远端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remote verification is a fresh observation of the exact ref, not a lock on the server. Remote CI, pull requests, branch protection approvals, and project tests are not checked by this flow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远端验证是对精确引用的一次新鲜观察，并不锁定服务器。此流程不检查远端 CI、拉取请求、分支保护审批或项目测试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remote ref independently verified": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已独立验证远端引用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remote still shows the previous commit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远端仍显示先前提交"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remote now points to a different commit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远端现已指向其他提交"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remote outcome is unknown": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远端结果未知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Observed remote commit: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "观察到的远端提交：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last remote destination: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次远端目标：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last remote ref: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次远端引用：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last remote check observed the published commit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次远端检查已观察到所发布的提交"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last remote outcome requires review; no automatic retry was made": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次远端结果需要复查；未进行自动重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter an exact HTTPS repository URL with a plain ASCII DNS host and path. Usernames, ports, escapes, queries, redirects, and other protocols are not supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请输入主机名为普通 ASCII DNS 名称的精确 HTTPS 仓库地址。不支持用户名、端口、转义字符、查询参数、重定向或其他协议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This remote branch name is not supported. No wildcard, deletion, or force refspec is available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此远端分支名。不提供通配符、删除或强制 refspec。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The verified Apple HTTPS transport is unavailable. Install Apple Command Line Tools or Xcode; both worktrees are retained.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经过验证的 Apple HTTPS 传输工具不可用。请安装 Apple Command Line Tools 或 Xcode；两个工作树均保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The exact remote branch does not exist. This flow does not create remote branches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此精确远端分支不存在。本流程不会新建远端分支。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The remote commit cannot be proved to be an ancestor of the merged commit using local objects. No fetch or force push was attempted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地对象无法证明远端提交是已合并提交的祖先。未尝试 fetch 或强制推送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local target or exact remote branch changed after review. Inspect again before pushing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地目标或精确远端分支在复查后发生变化。推送前请重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The remote confirmation expired or was already used. Inspect again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远端确认已过期或已经使用。请重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The remote branch could not be verified. Check access in your Git client; no credentials or raw server diagnostics are displayed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证远端分支。请在 Git 客户端检查访问权限；不会显示凭据或原始服务器诊断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Existing commit signatures are preserved; signature trust is not checked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留既有提交签名，但不检查签名信任。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Existing Keychain entries may be host-scoped. The credential is used only for the displayed HTTPS URL; system Keychain access may require your permission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现有钥匙串条目可能按主机保存。凭据只用于显示的 HTTPS 地址；系统钥匙串访问可能需要你的许可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I allow a read-only check of this recorded remote using its existing Keychain credential": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我允许使用现有钥匙串凭据，对记录中的这个远端进行一次只读检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recheck recorded remote only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅复查记录中的远端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Choose a cache folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 选择缓存文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Select caches": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 选择缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Move selected caches to Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 将所选缓存移到废纸篓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a project or find Git projects in a folder. Only folders you choose are read; your files stay unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加项目，或在文件夹中查找 Git 项目。仅读取你选择的文件夹，不改动文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add one project or find projects in a folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加一个项目，或在文件夹中查找项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced details": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高级详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All disk images must be detached. Eject only images you opened yourself; leave system-managed images alone. MoeKit does not identify or eject them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有磁盘映像均需卸载。只推出自己打开的映像，请勿操作系统管理的映像。MoeKit 不会识别或推出它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analysis, cleanup and process stopping are reviewed before they run. Uninstall, maintenance and live status are not available yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析、清理和停止进程前都需复查确认。卸载、维护和实时状态尚不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyze a folder, or import a Mole JSON report. Importing only reads the report. Reported sizes are not space you can necessarily free.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析文件夹，或导入 Mole JSON 报告。导入仅读取报告；显示大小不代表都能释放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built-in examples only. Your saved projects stay unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅使用内置示例，不改变已保存的项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache cleanup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存清理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache recovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check installed files or follow the setup guide. A found file still needs verification.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查已安装文件，或按指引设置。找到文件后仍需验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checked locations": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检测位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Add project, or Discover in folder to find Git projects. Review the results before adding them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击「添加项目」，或用「在文件夹中发现…」查找 Git 项目，复查后再添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Start scan in Processes & Ports. Select a process to see its details.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「进程与端口」点击「开始扫描」，选择进程查看详情。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Start scan to see your processes and listening ports. Scanning does not stop anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击「开始扫描」查看你的进程和监听端口。扫描不会停止任何进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a folder, then inspect it. Inspection does not change files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择文件夹后再检查，检查不会改动文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a task to see its results.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择任务查看结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose caches to remove": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择要清理的缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose items to delete": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择要删除的项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Closing a window may cancel its work. MoeKit stays open until you quit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭窗口可能取消其中的操作。退出应用前，MoeKit 会保持运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirming creates this private folder and recovery records containing the original path. Records are kept. Cancelling creates none of them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认后会创建此私有文件夹，并保留含原始路径的恢复记录。取消则不会创建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current session only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅保留本次会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletion results": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discovery limits": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发现范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explore Projects, Tools and Tasks. Choose Exit demo to return to your own data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览项目、工具和任务，点击「退出示例」回到自己的数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explore with built-in example data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用内置示例熟悉界面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find a first step.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从这里开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub receives update requests, which may include your app version and IP address. Project data and system profiles are not sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新请求发送给 GitHub，可能包含应用版本和 IP 地址；不发送项目数据或系统配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imported report": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已导入报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect a cache folder, select items, then review. A cache label does not mean its contents are safe to remove.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查缓存文件夹，选择项目后复查。标为缓存不代表内容都能安全删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Internal build %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内部构建 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last stop result": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近停止结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Latest result": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load MoeKit’s cache records. Restore and permanent deletion each need a new review and confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取 MoeKit 的缓存记录。恢复和永久删除均需重新复查并单独确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load MoeKit’s recovery records. Restoring needs a new confirmation and never replaces an existing file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取 MoeKit 的恢复记录。恢复时需重新确认，且不会覆盖已有文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load records": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load recovery records": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取恢复记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit may create the parent folders and lock files listed above. These locks coordinate MoeKit instances only; other apps can still access the file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 可能创建上列父目录和锁文件。锁仅协调 MoeKit 实例，其他应用仍可访问文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit rejects quarantined files. Neither MoeKit nor this command removes macOS protection. Do not switch download routes to bypass a security warning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 拒绝带隔离标记的文件；应用和此命令都不会移除 macOS 保护。请勿更换下载途径来绕过安全警告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not available yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only folders you choose are read. Your project list is saved locally; project files stay unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅读取所选文件夹。项目列表保存在本机，不改动项目文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the items and contents listed below will be permanently deleted. Trash and MoeKit cannot restore them. New arrivals are not included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅永久删除下列项目及内容，废纸篓和 MoeKit 均无法恢复。之后新进入的项目不在范围内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opening the workspace does not start a scan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开工作区不会开始扫描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other folder…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他文件夹…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permanently delete": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "永久删除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permanently delete all scanned items?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "永久删除全部扫描项？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permanently delete selected items?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "永久删除所选项？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Previous operations": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "历史操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Project discovery and process scan results appear here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目发现和进程扫描的结果会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Projects and tools, in one place": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目与工具，一处管理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read your processes and listening ports on demand. Stopping a process needs a separate confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按需读取你的进程和监听端口。停止进程时需单独确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading the report only. No files are changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅读取报告，不改动文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads file information only; does not run the tool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅读取文件信息，不运行工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads your process names and executable paths, working folders and TCP listening ports. Command arguments and environment variables are not read. Scans run only when requested and send no stop signals.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取你的进程名称、可执行文件路径、工作目录和 TCP 监听端口，不读取命令参数或环境变量。仅在你请求时扫描，不发送停止信号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reports may be incomplete. Reported sizes are not space you can necessarily free.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告可能不完整，显示大小不代表都能释放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Results by item": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐项结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review all scanned items…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查全部扫描项…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review move to Trash…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查移到废纸篓…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review selected items…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查所选项…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review selection…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查所选项…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review stop…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查停止…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan details": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan your home Trash, then select items to review. Deletion is permanent. Clearing the scanned items also requires typing EMPTY.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描主目录废纸篓，再选择项目复查。删除后无法恢复；清空本次扫描结果还需输入 EMPTY。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scans start when you choose. Changes need your confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由你决定何时扫描，改动前需确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See progress and results in Tasks. Git changes are not checked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「任务」查看进度和结果。尚未检查 Git 文件改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See running processes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看运行中的进程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See what takes up space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看空间占用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See your running processes and listening ports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看你的进程和监听端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select a project to see its location": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择项目查看位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select an entry to see its path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择条目查看路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select one .dmg from a fresh Downloads analysis. MoeKit checks the file before asking to move it to Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从本次「下载」文件夹分析中选择一个 .dmg。MoeKit 检查文件后才会请求移到废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Finder 中显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sizes do not guarantee free space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示大小不等于可释放空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Star on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 GitHub 点赞"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopping requires confirmation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止前需确认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Supported folders and protections": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持范围与保护措施"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This disk image moves to macOS Trash. Its storage is not freed until it is deleted from Trash. This action does not empty Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此磁盘映像会移到 macOS 废纸篓，删除前仍占用空间。本操作不会清空废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try the demo": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "体验示例"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates are signature-checked. Automatic installation runs when MoeKit quits; you can also install now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新会经过签名验证。自动安装在退出 MoeKit 时进行，也可以立即安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use built-in examples. Switching modes cancels discovery and report imports; project files stay unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用内置示例。切换模式会取消项目发现和报告导入，不改动项目文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User caches": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is read and saved": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取与保存内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is saved locally": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机保存内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What scanning reads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描读取内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your home Trash only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅当前用户的主目录废纸篓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If another app replaces the path, MoeKit may temporarily move the replacement before detecting it. This does not protect against malicious same-user interference.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若其他应用替换路径，MoeKit 可能在发现前暂时移动替换后的文件。本操作无法防范同一用户下的恶意干预。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No previous operations": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂无历史操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retire a clean worktree or remove a merged local branch. Files and refs move to recovery inside the main repository; no disk space is freed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退役干净的工作树，或移除已合并的本地分支。文件和引用会移入主仓库内的恢复目录，不会释放空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect target": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review operation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can restore during this session. After restarting, keep the recovery folder and its records of the original paths and commit. Recovery data is never cleared automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次会话中可恢复。重启后请保留恢复目录，以及记录原始路径和提交的凭据；恢复数据不会自动清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review commits, integrate them locally, then review retirement separately. An AI completion message does not verify saved files, merged commits or tests.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查提交并合入本地分支，再单独复查工作树退役。AI 说已完成，不代表文件已保存、提交已合并或测试已通过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Check source and target": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 检查来源与目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an existing local branch. Its clean main worktree can be updated. Diverged histories and unsupported layouts need Git outside MoeKit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择已有的本地分支，其干净的主工作树可以一并更新。历史分叉或不支持的布局需在 MoeKit 外使用 Git 处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check integration": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查合入方案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Untracked and ignored files are counted together. Both stay protected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未跟踪和被忽略的文件合并计数，均受保护。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resolve before integrating": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合入前需解决"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All source commits are already in the target. Review retirement separately in Git cleanup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来源提交已全部包含在目标中。请回到「Git 整理」单独复查退役。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fast-forward moves the target branch to the source commit. If checked out in the main worktree, its tracked files and index also change. The source files and branch stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快进会将目标分支移到来源提交。若目标已在主工作树检出，其已跟踪文件和暂存区也会更新。来源文件和分支保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close tools using both worktrees. Other apps can still write during these checks. Do not edit or run Git until verification finishes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先关闭使用这两个工作树的工具。检查期间其他应用仍可能写入；验证完成前请勿编辑或运行 Git。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This confirms local integration only. Retirement needs a separate review and confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次仅确认本地合入。退役需另行复查并确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local branch and any updated worktree match the source commit. Project behavior and tests are not verified.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地分支及已更新的工作树与来源提交一致，尚未验证项目行为或测试结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review worktree retirement": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复查工作树退役"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review again to move the clean worktree into recovery. Its branch stays, and no disk space is freed. A separate confirmation is required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再次复查后可将干净工作树移到恢复目录，分支会保留，不释放空间。仍需单独确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional: push to a remote": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选：推送到远端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter an HTTPS repository URL and an existing branch. MoeKit does not use saved remotes, fetch, create branches, force push or delete remote branches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入 HTTPS 仓库地址和已有分支。MoeKit 不使用保存的远端配置，也不拉取、创建分支、强推或删除远端分支。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check remote branch": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查远端分支"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This pushes the selected commit and all reachable Git history to the displayed repository, without force. Confirm only if this destination should receive the code and history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会将所选提交及所有可达 Git 历史推送到所示仓库，不强推。请确认该仓库可以接收这些代码和历史后再继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The worktree is kept. A timeout does not mean the push failed. Recheck the remote; do not send another push blindly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作树会保留。超时不代表推送失败，请重新检查远端，不要盲目再次推送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The remote check is a snapshot, not a server lock. Remote CI, pull requests, branch approvals and project tests are not checked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远端检查只是当时的结果，不会锁定服务器。此流程不检查远端 CI、拉取请求、分支审批或项目测试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checks the selected folder using a private temporary copy of Git data. No hooks, project scripts or network operations run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅检查所选文件夹，会在私有临时目录中复制 Git 数据。不运行钩子、项目脚本或网络操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspection details": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspection may read existing Keychain credentials. MoeKit does not display, log, save or erase them. Sign in with your Git client first if access is unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查时可能读取已有的钥匙串凭据。MoeKit 不显示、记录、保存或删除它们。如无法访问，请先在 Git 客户端登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connection details": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Git may use a shell only to dispatch MoeKit's fixed credential helper. Repository hooks are disabled; a native gate checks the approved push target.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Git 可能仅为调用 MoeKit 的固定凭据助手而使用 Shell。仓库钩子禁用，原生检查会核对已批准的推送目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chosen folders": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (partial)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（部分）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ at %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（%@）：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of %lld items": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld / %lld 个项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Git or protected project location overlaps this folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Git 或受保护的项目位置与此文件夹重叠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A different volume was skipped at %@. Its contents are not included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已跳过 %@ 处的其他卷，其内容未计入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A special filesystem item has no regular-file size: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "特殊文件系统项目没有常规文件大小：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A symbolic link was skipped at %@. Its target was not followed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已跳过 %@ 处的符号链接，未读取其指向的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cache folder validation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缓存目录检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cannot verify Git ancestry at %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证 %@ 的 Git 上级目录：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cannot verify protected location %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法验证受保护位置 %@：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking cleanup eligibility…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查清理条件…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cleanup folder validation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理目录检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cleanup validation could not be completed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法完成清理检查：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloud metadata validation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "云端元数据检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete cleanup manifest": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整清理清单检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete deletion manifest": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整删除清单检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Final protection validation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最终保护检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Git metadata was found in a containing folder: %@. Cleanup remains protected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在上级文件夹 %@ 中发现 Git 元数据，仍不允许清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measuring readable file sizes…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在统计可读取的文件大小…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Metadata could not be completely read at %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法完整读取 %@ 的元数据：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the first %lld items are listed. Choose a smaller folder to inspect the rest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅列出前 %lld 个项目。可选择更小的文件夹以检查其余内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Project catalog protection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目目录保护检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Protected location parent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "受保护位置的上级目录检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Protected-path validation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "受保护路径检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Readable sizes remain available for protected items. Partial sizes include only inspected file metadata; no link targets are followed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "受保护项目也会显示可读取的大小。部分大小仅包含已检查的文件元数据，不跟随链接目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Size is partial because the read-only scan reached its time, entry, or depth limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只读扫描已达到时间、条目数或深度上限，当前大小为部分结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder changed during the scan: %@. Scan again for a current size.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描期间文件夹发生变化：%@。重新扫描可获取当前大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The open-folder limit was reached at %@. The size is partial.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %@ 处达到同时打开文件夹的上限，大小为部分结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The path could not be opened without following links, or its identity changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法在不跟随链接的情况下打开路径，或其身份已发生变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The protected location is a link or unsupported object: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "受保护位置为链接或不支持的对象：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This check found unsupported ownership, permissions, ACL, file flags, or volume metadata.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此项检查发现不支持的所有权、权限、ACL、文件标志或卷元数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trash deletion eligibility": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "废纸篓删除条件检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why some items are unavailable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看不可用原因"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write-access ACL validation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写入权限 ACL 检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS denied read access to %@. Readable sizes are retained; inspect this location in Finder if needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 拒绝读取 %@。已保留可读部分的大小；需要时可在访达中检查该位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
